### Remmina (GUI backup option)

```bash
# Launch GUI
remmina &

# Open directly to a host
remmina -c rdp://username:password@$IP
```

> Remmina handles certificate errors through a click-through dialog and sometimes connects where command-line tools struggle. Good backup option.

